## Purpose: Establish a robust memory system for GPT personalities using ChromaDB

### Introduction to ChromaDB

ChromaDB is an open-source embedding database optimized for AI applications. For our GPT personality system, it will serve as the memory storage solution, allowing each personality to maintain context across conversations. This guide focuses on simple installation, minimal schema design, and straightforward Next.js integration.

