### Custom Index Creation

For more control over indexes, you can create them directly:

```typescript
// Create a text index for Post content
PostSchema.index({ title: 'text', content: 'text' }, { 
  weights: { title: 10, content: 5 },
  name: 'post_text_index',
});
```

### Index Management

Create a utility to manage indexes (`/lib/db/utils/indexManager.ts`):

```typescript
import { connectToDatabase } from '../index';
import { User, Lesson, Post, Session } from '../models';

/**
 * Ensure all indexes are created
 * Call this function during application initialization
 */
export async function ensureIndexes() {
  await connectToDatabase();

