## 1. Project Initialization

### Creating a New Next.js Project with TypeScript

```bash
# Create a new Next.js project with TypeScript and App Router
npx create-next-app@latest my-project --typescript --eslint --tailwind --app --src-dir

# Navigate to the project directory
cd my-project
```

This command initializes a Next.js project with:
