# AI Integration Guide: OpenAI and Anthropic with Next.js

## Introduction

This guide covers the integration of AI capabilities into your Next.js application using both OpenAI and Anthropic APIs. We'll walk through setting up the clients, implementing API routes for different AI features, and best practices for working with these AI services.

## Table of Contents

1. [Environment Setup](#environment-setup)
2. [OpenAI Integration](#openai-integration)
3. [Anthropic Integration](#anthropic-integration)
