- Implement proper error handling for all AI calls
- Use streaming responses for longer content generation
- Monitor costs and implement rate limiting
- Test thoroughly in development before deploying to production

The integration approach demonstrated here provides a solid foundation that can be extended with additional features and optimizations as your application evolves.

