### 3. Automating Deployment

Create a deployment script at `scripts/deploy.ps1`:

```powershell
# deploy.ps1
param (
    [string]$CommitMsg = "Automated deployment"
)

# Pull latest changes
git pull

# Install dependencies
npm ci

