## Introduction

This guide covers the integration of MongoDB with a Next.js application, focusing on a minimalist yet robust approach. MongoDB is a document-oriented NoSQL database that provides high performance, high availability, and easy scalability. Next.js is a React framework that enables server-side rendering and static site generation.

The integration will follow a clean architecture approach with clearly separated concerns:
- Database connection management
- Model definitions
